01:13:14.588 --> 01:13:16.590
Am I still wrong? Am I?!

832
01:13:17.257 --> 01:13:19.426
Alright, just lower your gun.

833
01:13:20.302 --> 01:13:23.179
Hey! What are you doing?!

834
01:13:23.263 --> 01:13:26.015
