885
01:16:41.336 --> 01:16:43.545
Hello? Hello!

886
01:16:43.546 --> 01:16:44.798
Hey!

887
01:16:47.008 --> 01:16:48.635
Son of a bitch...

888
01:17:22.168 --> 01:17:23.711
UNKNOWN CALLER ID

889
