You're not coming with?

930
01:20:38.323 --> 01:20:40.742
I'll come as soon as I finish work.

931
01:20:40.992 --> 01:20:42.368
When will that be?

932
01:20:42.702 --> 01:20:44.996
I'll be there ASAP, so get there first!

933
01:20:46.205 --> 01:20:48.665
