961
01:24:08.658 --> 01:24:09.951
So who killed him?

962
01:24:11.285 --> 01:24:12.662
You? Or me?

963
01:24:14.038 --> 01:24:15.039
Okay, well...

964
01:24:15.331 --> 01:24:16.832
That's not very important.

965
01:24:18.709 --> 01:24:20.253
