Look!

972
01:24:43.818 --> 01:24:47.071
I've been a fucking cop for a decade!

973
01:24:47.196 --> 01:24:49.740
Would I come here without an insurance?!

974
01:24:50.074 --> 01:24:52.535
If you fucking kill me,

975
01:24:53.703 --> 01:25:00.501
