978
01:25:08.634 --> 01:25:12.555
As well as the murders
of Lee and Det. Choi!

979
01:25:12.930 --> 01:25:15.516
I'm sure those are just
a few of your crimes,

980
01:25:15.891 --> 01:25:19.270
